/**
 * @page topic_keyboard_shortcuts Keyboard Shortcuts
 * @ingroup module_ui
 * @brief Current interactive keyboard bindings.
 *
 * The help overlay is generated from `lib/tui/shortcuts.c`, so this page mirrors
 * the application-level bindings without pretending that every modal screen
 * accepts every key. Press `?` for the same list at runtime.
 *
 * @section shortcuts_global Global TUI bindings
 *
 * | Key | Action | Availability |
 * | --- | --- | --- |
 * | `?` | Toggle the current help screen | Interactive screens |
 * | `]` | Open the live log viewer/searcher | Interactive screens |
 * | `=` | Open runtime statistics | Native builds |
 * | `0` | Open sync-primitives diagnostics | Debug builds |
 * | `` ` `` | Open errno-stack diagnostics | Diagnostic UI builds |
 * | `F12` | Open the version update checker | Native builds |
 * | `o`, `O`, `Ctrl-O` | Open media from a path or URL | Client/media screens |
 * | `q` / `Esc` | Quit ascii-chat normally | Interactive screens |
 * | `Shift-q` / `Shift-Esc` | Panic exit without cleanup | Interactive screens |
 *
 * @section shortcuts_media Media controls
 *
 * | Key | Action |
 * | --- | --- |
 * | `Space` | Pause or resume media |
 * | `Left` / `Right` | Seek backward or forward when supported |
 * | `Up` / `Down` | Increase or decrease speaker volume |
 * | `m` | Toggle mute |
 * | `c` | Cycle color mode |
 * | `r` | Cycle render mode |
 * | `f` | Cycle color filter |
 * | `x` / `y` | Toggle horizontal / vertical flip |
 * | `1` | Toggle Matrix rain |
 * | `2` | Toggle audio waveform |
 * | `3` | Toggle audio frequency display |
 * | `-` | Toggle FPS counter |
 * | `w` | Toggle face follow |
 * | `z` | Toggle Zalgo intensity |
 *
 * Audio visualizations require audio to be enabled. Pressing `2` or `3` selects
 * that visualization and disables the other visualization and Matrix rain.
 *
 * @section shortcuts_editing Prompt and navigation keys
 *
 * Text prompts support printable Unicode input, Backspace, Delete, Left/Right,
 * Home/End, Enter to accept, and Escape or Ctrl-C to cancel. Shift-Enter inserts
 * a newline in multiline prompts. Bracketed paste is inserted as one validated
 * value and cannot trigger application shortcuts.
 *
 * Log, sync, notice, and selection screens add local navigation such as
 * Up/Down, Page Up/Page Down, Home/End, and Escape. Their live help overlay is
 * authoritative when a local binding differs from the media screen.
 *
 * @section shortcuts_build_dependent Build-dependent keys
 *
 * The sync inspector is omitted from release builds, errno-stack diagnostics
 * require `ASCIICHAT_DIAGNOSTIC_UI`, and native-only controls are filtered from
 * browser help. This is why runtime help is generated rather than copied into
 * a static table.
 *
 * @see topic_tui
 * @see topic_keyboard
 * @see md_docs_2keyboard-input.html
 */
